%% Generic data read/write flow template
flowchart TD
    CALLER["Caller\n(API/service)"] --> DATA_READ["DATA_READ\n(read path)"]
    DATA_READ --> CACHE{"Cache hit?"}
    CACHE -->|yes| RETURN_READ["Return cached data"]
    CACHE -->|no| DB_READ["Read from primary store"]

    DB_READ --> MAP_READ["Map/serialize"]
    MAP_READ --> RETURN_READ

    CALLER --> DATA_WRITE["DATA_WRITE\n(write path)"]
    DATA_WRITE --> VALIDATE_WRITE{"Write validation pass?"}
    VALIDATE_WRITE -->|no| WRITE_FAIL["Reject write + error"]
    VALIDATE_WRITE -->|yes| DB_WRITE["Write to primary store"]
    DB_WRITE --> EVENT["Emit event/index update (optional)"]
    EVENT --> WRITE_OK["Write success"]

    %% TODO(verify): bind read/write nodes to real repositories/tables
